1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.600
The Hero Garp is...

3
00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:40.640
protecting the platform!

4
00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:46.550
Don't get intimidated. It's just a name, you fools!

5
00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:49.810
He's just an old marine.

6
00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:55.720
Since you're part of his generation,

7
00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.160
you'd do well to pay attention to the enemy in front of you!

8
00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.620
Crimson Dog Bite!

9
00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:13.170
You keep destroying the city...

10
00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.470
Like I said, try to protect it!

11
00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:20.180
<b>Monster</b>

12
00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.180
Make a path!

13
00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:22.480
A path to Ace's rescue!

14
00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.820
Those aggravating jerks came all the way here...

15
00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:36.030
Not gonna happen, you monster!

16
00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:40.870
We'll show you the power of the New World!

17
00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:50.350
Now, hurry!

18
00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:51.810
To the execution platform!

19
00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.100
What is it, Fire Fist?

20
00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.240
Ace...

21
00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:29.980
Gol D. Roger?

22
00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:33.450
You mean Gold Roger?

23
00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.620
If I know him?

24
00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:41.290
Hey, don't you know why there's so many pirates causing trouble in the world?

25
00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.340
It's all that Roger-guy's fault!

26
00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.460
Roger's...

27
00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:47.580
This is just what I've heard...

28
00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:54.070
but seems he spouted some crap about a
"great treasure" just before they executed him...

29
00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:58.370
So generations of pirates stupid enough
to believe him started roaming the seas.

30
00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:02.480
It'd be better if that guy was never born!

31
00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.610
He's scum!

32
00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:10.440
From the platform, before he died, he sent pirates out to sea to do whatever the hell they wanted!

33
00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:13.330
He was trouble when he was alive, and he's even more so now that he's dead!

34
00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:17.160
He's the worst trash in the world! Remember that!

35
00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.410
Huh? What's wrong?

36
00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.220
Why are you getting so upset?

37
00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:31.900
Say, who are you anyway, you little runt?

38
00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:50.330
What were you doing down in the village, Ace?

39
00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:56.890
There's a huge uproar down there because some delinquents were almost killed by a kid.

40
00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:01.140
What? And here I thought they were dead.

41
00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:07.380
What?! When you cause trouble, I'm the one who gets blamed, you know!

42
00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.610
You listening to me, Ace?!

43
00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:15.450
Sheesh! How could he push
such a troublemaker on me?

44
00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:18.560
You want to know about Roger, you say?

45
00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:25.700
He was...

46
00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:28.570
just a liar and a murderer!

47
00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:31.240
"Pirate King"? Don't make me laugh!

48
00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.190
He wasn't the Pirate King, more like the Bullshit King!

49
00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:36.410
You can say that again!

50
00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.150
Roger?

51
00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:46.400
Don't say such disgusting
names, kid. You'll spoil my beer.

52
00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:47.990
Get lost.

53
00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.290
Why're you lookin' at me like that?!

54
00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:56.220
Hey! What are you doing, you damn brat?!

55
00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:05.840
Why are you looking so beat down?

56
00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:13.310
Hey, Ace!

57
00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:17.250
Looks like you've been causing a lot of trouble lately.

58
00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.820
Gramps...

59
00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:25.360
You have a grandson, right?

60
00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.960
Does he seem happy to you?

61
00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:33.030
Oh, you mean Luffy?

62
00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.430
I'm raising him well.

63
00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:37.270
Gramps.

64
00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:43.510
Was it...

65
00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:48.370
good that I was born?

66
00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.730
Well, you...

67
00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:01.490
As long as you're alive, you'll figure it out eventually.

68
00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:09.630
Hurry and bring Straw Hat-boy to the ship!

69
00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:13.730
Now that it's come to this, vwe'll just have to save Ace-boy vourselves!

70
00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:18.080
Iva-chan...

71
00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.910
Vyou're still conscious?!

72
00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:26.420
I have one last favor to ask of you...

73
00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:33.730
Just a little further! We're coming now, Ace!

74
00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:36.530
Clear a path!

75
00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:40.190
I'm...

76
00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.840
Dammit!

77
00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:56.050
Ace-san, wait for me! I will save you even if it costs me my life!

78
00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.810
Almost there!

79
00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.500
Here we come, Ace!

80
00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:06.550
Ace! We'll definitely save you!

81
00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:08.310
Wait for us, Ace!

82
00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.560
Don't you dare give up!

83
00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:17.630
Dammit! What's wrong with me?! This isn't the time to...

84
00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:22.300
Pops, my brother and my crew...

85
00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:25.040
are falling, and yet...

86
00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:29.360
"One last favor"?! Don't say such ominous things!

87
00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:33.310
Please, give me...

88
00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:37.810
I'm so happy...

89
00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:40.260
my tears won't stop...

90
00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:44.050
Even now that it's come to this...

91
00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:46.760
I want to live...

92
00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.240
Captain Buggy, you're awake!

93
00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:57.290
You're alive!

94
00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:58.740
Thank goodness!

95
00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.980
What happened to me?

96
00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:05.000
You were frozen by that Aokiji-guy.

97
00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.080
Oh no!

98
00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:24.790
Hear me, Navy! You'd better prepare yourselves!

99
00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.570
Don't think I'm the kind of man who'll let it end with this!

100
00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:32.310
Yeah! We'll get our revenge before long! I'd expect no less from you!

101
00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:34.280
Indeed, my friend!

102
00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:37.820
But... what am I gonna do?!

103
00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:41.160
Move it, Magma-brat!

104
00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:56.330
Damn it to Hell...

105
00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:57.500
Pops!

106
00:11:00.610 --> 00:11:03.890
So even you can't fight old age, huh?

107
00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.560
Whitebeard!

108
00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.580
The one thing we'd feared the most...

109
00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:16.070
You want me to wear this equipment so the enemy will feel sorry for me or something?!

110
00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.250
Pops...

111
00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:22.820
The battle is over once you let your guard down, even for a second!

112
00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:26.360
Marco!

113
00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.470
You just got distracted, didn't you?

114
00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.340
Jozu!

115
00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:46.200
Now, I guess it's time for me to send you off to the next world!

116
00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.660
Pops!

117
00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.070
Hey, Pops...

118
00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:02.470
What?!

119
00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:07.430
Vyou want another shot of the Tension Hormones?!

120
00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:09.050
That's too reckless!

121
00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:14.210
It's hopeless! Vyou and Vi fought our way out of Impel Down together, didn't vwe?!

122
00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:18.900
Vyour body has been fatally poisoned and
then brought back from the brink of death...

123
00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:20.990
It's way beyond its limits!

124
00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:28.430
Didn't Vi tell you before? The Tension Hormones are nothing but an emergency treatment!

125
00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:33.660
If Vi keep deceiving vyour body, vyou really will die after this is all over!

126
00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:42.700
As long as I've done all I can,

127
00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:49.180
then I don't mind dying!

128
00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:53.710
Please let me fight, Iva-chan!

129
00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:00.590
Pops was done in!

130
00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:02.090
Marco! Jozu!

131
00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.930
If... I don't fight here...

132
00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.830
If... I can't save Ace...

133
00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:10.570
I'll...

134
00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:14.870
end up wanting to die!

135
00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:21.250
Please... Give me the power to fight!

136
00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.190
And Vi'm telling vyou...

137
00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:33.830
If Vi allow vyou to die, Vi won't be able to show my face to Dragon afterwards!

138
00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.290
Vyou ignorant fool!

139
00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:43.570
Ace...

140
00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:49.400
Fine!

141
00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:52.970
Do whatever the hell...

142
00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.630
vyou want!

143
00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.940
Hey, you! What are you doing to Straw Hat?

144
00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:17.970
S-Straw Hat's...

145
00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:26.510
I-Impossible! I thought he was on the verge of death after taking Kizaru-san's attack head-on!

146
00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:31.180
Luffy...

147
00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:34.990
Ace!

148
00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:40.970
Straw Hat-boy, once again, you better keep in mind...

149
00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:45.800
that the next time you drop, you won't be able to bounce back!

150
00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:48.830
Those guys!

151
00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:57.780
Wait!

152
00:14:57.780 --> 00:14:59.960
They're trying to execute Ace again!

153
00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:05.350
Oh, well, my words can't change Straw Hat-boy's mind under these circumstances!

154
00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:12.780
All I can do is keep them from beating him!

155
00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:13.790
Straw Hat?!

156
00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.860
Straw Hat is coming!

157
00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:17.960
Kill Straw Hat!

158
00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.910
I'm gonna finish him!

159
00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:44.560
It's not over! I won't let you pass through here!

160
00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.320
If you wanna advance...

161
00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:49.070
You gotta beat all of us!

162
00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:51.930
We'll show you the spirit of the Navy!

163
00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.330
Heads up!

164
00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.600
Death Wink!

165
00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.630
10 points! I'll back you up!

166
00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:13.260
Thanks, Ivan-chan!

167
00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:23.390
Luffy-san...

168
00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.530
Koby!

169
00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:40.370
That's right! In order to
live as a Navy soldier,

170
00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.640
I have to fight to change myself!

171
00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:46.510
Because this is a battlefield!

172
00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:52.990
I have to commit myself towards killing him!

173
00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:57.770
Rubber-Rubber...

174
00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:03.070
Shave!

175
00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:09.710
Bullet!

176
00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:19.220
He's as strong as I thought...

177
00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.140
What is it this time?!

178
00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:29.390
You guys are...

179
00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:31.380
the Kuma imposters!

180
00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.570
Monkey D. Luffy.

181
00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.730
Oh no! What a pain in the ass!

182
00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.260
Hey you, watch out!

183
00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.560
Boa Hancock. One of the Seven Warlords.

184
00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:01.020
Abort attack. Friendly operative.

185
00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:03.340
That's right! You guys are on the same side!

186
00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:05.110
Thank you, Hancock!

187
00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:11.140
She's the Empress, right?
How do you know her?

188
00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:14.910
Luffy! He called my name again...

189
00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:17.990
Move aside, Boa Hancock.

190
00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:21.400
I don't want you to call my name!

191
00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:33.100
P-Pops...

192
00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.970
I-I'm on my way!

193
00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.270
You are off guard!

194
00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:44.740
Pops!

195
00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:48.280
Things don't always go the way you want!

196
00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:51.730
Of course, Marco the Phoenix regenerates!

197
00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:55.160
Hey! It's your turn now!

198
00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:06.200
Seastone?!

199
00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:10.960
Commander Marco!

200
00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:17.970
It looks painful!

201
00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:20.730
Commander Jozu has been beaten, too!

202
00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:29.710
They even beat our commanders one by one...

203
00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:34.160
The Whitebeard Pirates are falling apart...

204
00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:41.890
Pops!

205
00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.230
You Fishman monster!

206
00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:46.870
Let me go!

207
00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:48.830
Now move it!

208
00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:53.000
Everyone, attack Whitebeard!

209
00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:08.020
Pops!

210
00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.260
Pops!

211
00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.890
Stay away!

212
00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:26.370
These guys... do they really think...

213
00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.540
they can beat me this easily?

214
00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:39.380
I don't need any help because I'm...

215
00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.250
I'm...

216
00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:47.800
I'm Whitebeard!

217
00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:42.300
M-Monster!

218
00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:56.610
If I were to die...

219
00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:04.000
I know exactly...

220
00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:06.770
what it would mean!

221
00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:14.140
Then, you know,

222
00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:19.880
I can't allow myself to die until...

223
00:22:21.990 --> 00:22:26.880
I see a bright future ahead for my sons!

224
00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:36.760
Right, Ace?

225
00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:42.240
Pops!

226
00:22:49.150 --> 00:22:50.480
You just refuse to die!

227
00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:54.690
What is it?!

228
00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:05.010
W-What are they doing?!
Guarding the back of Whitebeard?!

229
00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:08.430
Are they willing to die with Whitebeard?!

230
00:23:10.000 --> 00:23:12.760
You people will never understand!

231
00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:17.620
We'll defend Pops' glory!

232
00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:25.180
You're getting too worked up, you fools!

233
00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:31.090
If you wanna see the future,
I'll show you now, Whitebeard!

234
00:23:31.580 --> 00:23:32.570
Do it!

235
00:23:37.090 --> 00:23:39.430
Ace!

236
00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:43.000
Ace!

237
00:23:44.670 --> 00:23:46.340
That won't work!

238
00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:50.170
Do you really think that would stop...

239
00:23:57.450 --> 00:24:00.280
Behold, Whitebeard!

240
00:24:04.120 --> 00:24:05.020
Stop it!

241
00:24:21.970 --> 00:24:22.910
Stop it!

242
00:24:39.660 --> 00:24:46.260
Stop it!

243
00:25:20.540 --> 00:25:23.780
Here I come!

244
00:25:23.780 --> 00:25:25.770
What did vyou just do?!

245
00:25:25.770 --> 00:25:28.610
Conqueror's... Haki?!

246
00:25:30.460 --> 00:25:32.810
Hey, hey! Seriously?!

247
00:25:35.200 --> 00:25:37.780
How surprising...

248
00:25:48.490 --> 00:25:50.590
That kid...

249
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:30.410 line:8% position:5% align:start size:45%
